Keeping up to date with trends in the local residential property market, as well as the general market;
Ensure that a price is agreed that is acceptable to both buyer and seller.
Education & Experience
Must love sales;
Customer service orientation;
Adhering to strong principles and values;
Adapting and responding to change;
Coping with pressure and setbacks;
Be able to work under pressure.
