Ability to translate business challenges into AI-driven solutions and communicate complex technical concepts to non-technical stakeholders;
Strong analytical skills and mindset, crucial for analyzing data, identifying trends, and making data-driven decisions;
Agility, strong drive for results, ability to deliver on time and under challenging situations, effective communication skills, and proficiency in stakeholder and change management;
Proficiency in English.

